#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Welcome to *Fundamentals of Quantum Algorithms,* the second course in the "
"*Understanding Quantum Information and Computation* series comprising the "
"following courses:\n"
msgstr ""
"Maligayang pagdating sa *Fundamentals of Quantum Algorithms,* ang ikalawang "
"kurso sa serye ng *Understanding Quantum Information and Computation* na "
"binubuo ng mga sumusunod na kurso:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-"
"information)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-"
"information)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Fundamentals of quantum algorithms (this course)\n"
msgstr "Fundamentals of quantum algorithms (ang kursong ito)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[General formulation of quantum information](/learning/courses/general-"
"formulation-of-quantum-information)\n"
msgstr ""
"[General formulation of quantum information](/learning/courses/general-"
"formulation-of-quantum-information)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Foundations of quantum error correction](/learning/courses/foundations-of-"
"quantum-error-correction)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Foundations of quantum error correction](/learning/courses/foundations-of-"
"quantum-error-correction)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course explores computational advantages of quantum information, including what we can do with quantum computers and their advantages over classical computers.\n"
"It begins with quantum query algorithms, which offer simple proof-of-concept demonstrations for quantum algorithms, and then moves on to quantum algorithms for problems\n"
"including integer factorization and unstructured search.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tinutuklas ng kursong ito ang mga computational na kalamangan ng quantum information, kabilang dito kung ano ang magagawa natin sa mga quantum computer at ang kanilang mga kalamangan kumpara sa mga klasikal na computer.\n"
"Nagsisimula ito sa mga quantum query algorithm, na nagbibigay ng simpleng proof-of-concept na demonstrasyon para sa mga quantum algorithm, at pagkatapos ay lumipat sa mga quantum algorithm para sa mga problemang\n"
"tulad ng integer factorization at unstructured search.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is intended for students, professionals, and hobbyists in fields"
" such as computer science, physics, engineering, and mathematics who are "
"eager to gain knowledge on the theoretical foundations of quantum "
"information and computation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kursong ito ay para sa mga estudyante, propesyonal, at hobbyist sa mga "
"larangang tulad ng computer science, pisika, inhinyeriya, at matematika na "
"sabik na makakuha ng kaalaman sa mga teoretikal na pundasyon ng quantum "
"information at computation.\n"

